# Local Python runtime for the phoneme GOP worker (torch + transformers, multi-GB
# and platform-specific). The worker is located via PHONEME_GOP_PYTHON, so this
# path is a convention, not a requirement — nothing here belongs in the repo.
/ml/venv/

